    {
      "seq": 24,
      "kind": "submit",
      "at": 1791933352364,
      "reason": "_dense_tail now unrolls the common 8-lane case (three tail multipliers, used when the padded digit count is 512 to 2047). It splits the integer into high and low halves, so each lane is pulled out of a half-size number, and it merges the lanes in one expression. That drops the list comprehension, the iter/zip pair loops and the full-width shifts. The lanes and multipliers are the same and the merges happen in the same order, so the results are identical. Measured: decode_autofix_ir 0.9714, int_codec_ir 0.9915, the others neutral, equivalence identical."
    }
  ],
